\fB\&-endian\fR\fR\& [\fR\fInumber\fI\fR\&] 
.br
Set the endian mode of the generated assembly language. This affects the \
assembly code generated for double precision data initializations, bit fields, \
and some argument passing. The default endian mode is 0, or little endian. \
The endian mode 1 sets big endian mode. Note that big endian is not \
thoroughly tested. 
.RE
